## 0. Summary (non-binding)

Xninetzy is a local-first, MCP-only personal intelligence and learning
server. The Work is source-available: you may read, build, run, fork,
and contribute back. Commercial use, redistribution as a hosted or
SaaS service, and use in production by an entity other than the
Licensee are restricted without a separate written agreement.

The full terms below are the only binding grant. The summary above is
informational and does not modify the license.

