4. install skills and source adapters from the Work for Personal Use;
5. submit Contributions back to the Licensee under Section 5.

The MCP server is the only public interface exposed by the Work. Use
of the Work as a backend for a hosted, multi-tenant, or shared service
is **not** Personal Use.

